		{
			"id": "A1nXCrm4d1v_E1CZY",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the reviewed package: ST 45, DX 9, IQ 6, HT 15, HP 45, WILL 10, PER 10, FP 30, SPEED 6, MOVE 6, DODGE 9, DR 4. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "AjTbtaKDSev-GqTNq",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 110 (offense 64, protection 46), threat tier severe, appearing 1."
		},
		{
			"id": "AoQXrSEILkDq_OVlw",
			"text": "Heat (3d burning), reach C: No attack roll and no active defense. Anything that touches the remorhaz takes 3d burning damage from extreme heat."
		},
